["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"entity-runtime","stream_identity":"01a0cab7-1ed7-77a5-8384-ff10c92e7ad6","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIG2042082378cf0b9bd855b2f23c06a72c593187f32caa432127b725d9614c4913","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/hybrid-provider","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":4,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: A composite over a local provider and a remote one\n\n## Outcome\n\nSomebody who wants a local copy for speed and a server for truth gets both behind one `Store`, and\nthe caller above it does not change.\n\n## Context\n\n`entity-store` gives the traits and `entity-remote` gives a second implementation of them. The\ncomposite is what makes the pair useful — and it is the place where the four policy words from\n`story:authority-and-conflict` are actually spent.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n`entity-hybrid` (in `entity-remote`) implements `Store` over a local `Store` and a remote one; it\npasses the conformance suite with the remote as authority and with the local store as authority; a\nstale answer is only ever served when the policy says so, and the answer says it was stale at the\npoint of use. R-106, R-107.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nBackground replication, a sync daemon, and any scheduling. The composite acts when it is called.\n\n## Open Questions\n\nNone outstanding.\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:centralized-and-hybrid-storage"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"One Store implementation over two, whose behaviour is entirely the declared policy.","title":"A composite over a local provider and a remote one"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIG2042082378cf0b9bd855b2f23c06a72c593187f32caa432127b725d9614c4913","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":4,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIG2042082378cf0b9bd855b2f23c06a72c593187f32caa432127b725d9614c4913"]}]